{"id":"5f1189395eacb239","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-comb8-independent-family.md","title":"ZFC Comb8 Independent Family","display":"df-zfc-comb8-independent-family — ZFC Comb8 Independent Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb8-independent-family","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb8-independent-family","58-df-zfc-comb7-independent-family","58-df-zfc-comb5-independent-family"],"display":"df-zfc-comb8-independent-family — ZFC Comb8 Independent Family","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb8-independent-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb8-independent-family</span><span>58-df-zfc-comb7-independent-family</span><span>58-df-zfc-comb5-independent-family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb8-independent-family — ZFC Comb8 Independent Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I,F,G\\in V,\\ \\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega),\\ F,G\\in[\\mathcal I]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathcal I,F,G\\in V,\\ \\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega),\\ F,G\\in[\\mathcal I]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb8IndependentFamily}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcComb7IndependentFamily}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcComb5IndependentFamily}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb8IndependentFamily}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcComb7IndependentFamily}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcComb5IndependentFamily}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb8\\text{-}independent\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb8IndependentFamily}_S(\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\land\\forall F,G\\in[\\mathcal I]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\Bigl(F\\cap G=\\varnothing\\land F\\cup G\\neq\\varnothing\\to\\bigl|\\{n\\in\\omega\\mid(\\forall A\\in F\\;n\\in A)\\land(\\forall B\\in G\\;n\\notin B)\\}\\bigr|=\\omega\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb8\\text{-}independent\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb8IndependentFamily}_S(\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\land\\forall F,G\\in[\\mathcal I]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\Bigl(F\\cap G=\\varnothing\\land F\\cup G\\neq\\varnothing\\to\\bigl|\\{n\\in\\omega\\mid(\\forall A\\in F\\;n\\in A)\\land(\\forall B\\in G\\;n\\notin B)\\}\\bigr|=\\omega\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb8\\text{-}independent\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb7IndependentFamily}_S(\\mathcal{I})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcComb8IndependentFamily}_S(\\mathcal{I})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb8\\text{-}independent\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb7IndependentFamily}_S(\\mathcal{I})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcComb8IndependentFamily}_S(\\mathcal{I})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb8\\text{-}independent\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb5IndependentFamily}_S(\\mathcal{I})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcComb8IndependentFamily}_S(\\mathcal{I})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb8\\text{-}independent\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb5IndependentFamily}_S(\\mathcal{I})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcComb8IndependentFamily}_S(\\mathcal{I})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary independent family definition.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-comb7-independent-family</code> and <code>58-df-zfc-comb5-independent-family</code> are merged here; they used equivalent finite Boolean-combination formulations.</li>\n<li>The set-builder makes the ambient set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> explicit, so <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=\\varnothing\">\\(F=\\varnothing\\)</span> or <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=\\varnothing\">\\(G=\\varnothing\\)</span> does not rely on an undefined empty-intersection convention.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal I,F,G\\in V,\\ \\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega),\\ F,G\\in[\\mathcal I]^{<\\omeg